{"title": "Heavy Armour Master", "pageid": 8382, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heavy_Armour_Master", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Sources of damage reduction"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Heavy_Armour_Master.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Heavy_Armour_Master.webp/300px-Heavy_Armour_Master.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Heavy_Armour_Master.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Heavy_Armour_Master.webp/300px-Heavy_Armour_Master.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Heavy_Armour_Master.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Heavy Armour Master</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. Your mastery over heavy armour increases, granting you damage reduction of incoming non-magical<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> physical damage by 3.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n</p><p>Incoming damage from non-magical attacks also decreases by 3 while you're wearing heavy armour. \n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Requires Proficiency with Heavy Armour</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Armour_Master_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heavy Armour Master (Feat)\">Heavy Armour Master (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feat only works if the character is wearing heavy <i>body</i> armour. For example, it doesn't apply if the character is only wearing <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grymskull_Helm\" title=\"Grymskull Helm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Grymskull_Helm_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Grymskull_Helm\" title=\"Grymskull Helm\">Grymskull Helm</a> which counts as Heavy Armour in terms of required proficiency.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This feat works for all incoming physical damage (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a>), no matter magical or not.\n<ul><li>This feature limitation only works as expected for self-damage. Which means <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Axe\" title=\"Ritual Axe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Handaxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Axe\" title=\"Ritual Axe\">Ritual Axe</a> self-damage doesn't get damage reduction from this feat, as it's the only magical physical self damage effect in the game.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1985/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17873/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10188/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1033811/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.896      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   56.896      1 -total\n 28.86%   16.423      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 24.22%   13.782      2 Template:Item_icon\n 19.19%   10.917      1 Template:Prereq\n 19.06%   10.843      3 Template:DamageType\n 18.53%   10.544     28 Template:Trim\n 17.14%    9.753      3 Template:Icon_link\n 16.02%    9.113      3 Template:Icon_text\n 14.52%    8.259      1 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8382-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203914 and revision id 391249. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}